    "chunk_text": "Kasun Delgolla brings over 14 years of experience in software engineering, enterprise architecture, AI, cybersecurity, and digital transformation to his role as Chief Technology Officer at Surge Global, expanding now to cover Calcey Technologies. Having served as the chief architect behind many of the company\u2019s large-scale enterprise programs, his expertise spans cloud-native platforms, AI-powered products, data ecosystems, and secure enterprise architectures.\n\nYohan Wijesiriwardane co-founded Payable twelve years ago with a clear mandate to make world-class payment infrastructure accessible to every merchant. Under his leadership, Payable grew into a platform processing Rs. 6 billion in monthly transactions across 45,000 merchants, delivering industry firsts including South Asia\u2019s inaugural Tap2Phone solution and instant merchant settlements."
