    "description": "The price of promotion: Why Sri Lanka\u2019s reclassified wealth is a macroeconomic mirage",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/The-price-of-promotion-Why-Sri-Lanka-s-reclassified-wealth-is-a-macroeconomic-mirage/4-794765",
