    "description": "School bus crash kills at least 20 pupils in Uganda",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/breaking-news/School-bus-crash-kills-at-least-20-pupils-in-Uganda/108-345908",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailymirrorlk",
