    "description": "\u2018Giving up was never an option\u2019: The fisherman \u00a0who fought back after losing millions in SL",
    "url_metadata": "http://island.lk/giving-up-was-never-an-option-the-fisherman-who-fought-back-after-losing-millions-in-sl/",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "islandlk",
