    "description": "Sri Lanka to deploy AI-driven \u2018horizontal lending rail\u2019 to democratise credit access",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/business-main/Sri-Lanka-to-deploy-AI-driven-horizontal-lending-rail-to-democratise-credit-access/245-346050",
    "lang": "en",
