    "chunk_size_bytes": 973,
    "chunk_text": "Devdutt Pattanaik: The renowned mythologist, author, and corporate consultant will offer an unconventional perspective, breaking down the \u201cMonsoon Market Myth\u201d to explain how deep-rooted cultural narratives shape consumer behaviour and market dynamics in South Asia.\n\nBeyond the headliners, the forum will feature an eclectic mix of Sri Lankan and Indian panellists, combining the practical grit of corporate lawyers, diplomatic tact of former ambassadors, strategic vision of political leaders, and sharp insights from think-tank scholars and media professionals. Discussions will also explore the role of youth in regional integration, the current investment landscape, and practical ways to reduce bureaucratic and economic barriers to trade.\n\nTickets are limited and expected to sell out quickly. Corporate delegates and interested professionals can reserve their seats and purchase tickets directly through the official booking link: https://indiacalling.rush.lk/."
