    "chunk_text": "The 2026 World Cup Final descended into hooliganism\n\nSpain finally won the 2026 FIFA World Cup final during extra time at the MetLife Stadium in the US on Sunday. Then hell broke loose as fights broke out between the two teams. Some Argentine players lost control of their emotions and attacked Spain\u2019s substitutes and staff who ran on to the pitch to celebrate their 1- 0 win against the South American team.\n\nBritain\u2019s wartime premier Winston Churchill once phrased rugby as \u201ca hooligans\u2019 game played by gentlemen\u201d and its counterpart football as a \u201cgentleman\u2019s game played by hooligans\u201d. The finals of the 2026 Football World Cup was sadly reduced the status of a \u2018hooligan\u2019s game\u2019 referred to by Churchill.\n\nA sad finish to the controversial 2026 Football World Cup Tournament. The tournament was marred by controversy even before a ball was kicked.\n\nFIFA Chief Infantino politicised the tournament even before the tournament commenced by bestowing a \u2018FIFA Peace Prize\u2019 to American President Donald Trump. The move was seen worldwide, as an attempt to boost the ego of the American leader who was angered that the Nobel Committee did not bestow on him the \u2018Nobel Peace Prize\u2019.\n\nThe Nobel Committees are specialised working bodies responsible for evaluating nominations and recommending laureates for the various\u00a0 Prizes. There are six committees, each operating under its respective awarding institution in Sweden and Norway. The Nobel Peace Prize is evaluated by the Norwegian Nobel Committee, which consists of five members appointed by the Norwegian Parliament.\n\nThe inaugural FIFA Peace Prize was awarded to Donald Trump in December 2025 on the grounds of his \u201cexceptional and extraordinary actions for peace\u201d and for \u201cpromoting peace and unity around the world\u201d."
