    "chunk_size_bytes": 996,
    "chunk_text": "MAS\u2019 Rajiv Dharmendra joins Serendib Land Board\n\nSerendib Land PLC has appointed Rajiv Dharmendra to its Board as an Independent Non-Executive Director.\n\nDharmendra is the Chief Executive Officer of MAS Intimates and has over 21 years of experience with MAS Holdings. During his career, he has held several senior leadership positions, including Business Director \u2013 MAS Intimates, CEO of Silueta, Director \u2013 Limited Brands, and Chief Marketing Officer of MAS Intimates. He also leads the MAS Innovation Board, which oversees the Group\u2019s innovation strategy and pipeline.\n\nDharmendra holds a BSc. in Mathematics and Economics from King\u2019s College, London and an MSc. in Finance from the London School of Economics. His executive education was from the business schools of Harvard and INSEAD. He was appointed to the Board of the Sri Lanka Insurance Corporation in the capacity of a Non \u2013 Executive Director to both Life and General Insurance companies with effect from 1st January 2025."
