    "chunk_text": "Bus fire kills seven passengers in Vietnam\n\nTHE HINDU - At \u200bleast seven passengers \u200cwere killed when a \u200bbus \u2060caught fire in southern Vietnam early \u200con Tuesday, police said.\n\nThe \u200cbus was \u200ctraveling \u2060from Lam \u2060Dong province to the nearby business hub \u200bHo \u200cChi Minh City when it caught fire, \u200cwith flames quickly \u200bengulfing the 24-seat vehicle \u2060and passengers inside trapped, the police-led \u200cMinistry of Public Security said in a statement.\n\nPolice have launched an \u200cinvestigation into \u200bthe cause of the fire. State \u2060media reports said \u2060five other passengers \u200cwere injured."
