    "chunk_text": "Animals Amendment Bill presented to Parliament\n\nColombo, July 21 (Daily Mirror) - The Animals Amendment Bill which aims to amend the Animals Act, No. 29 of 1958, was presented to Parliament by the Minister of Agriculture and Livestock today."
