    "chunk_text": "My last days in Parliament: MP Archchuna\n\nColombo, July 21 (Daily Mirror) - Referring to his political future, independent MP Ramanathan Archchuna today said he is currently spending his last days in Parliament.\n\n\"I will not be in Parliament for long. I will be in Parliament for two more weeks only,\" he told the House.\n\nHe said the case filed by Oshala Herath asking the Judiciary to remove me from Parliament will create a wrong impression that Sinhalese people do not want independent MPs."
