    "chunk_text": "First Capital Asset Management successfully concludes Professional Fund Programme for University of Kelaniya\n\nFirst Capital Asset Management Limited (FCAM), the wealth management arm of First Capital Holdings PLC, a subsidiary of JXG (Janashakthi Group), recently concluded its Professional Fund Management short course conducted for students of the Department of Finance, Faculty of Commerce and Management Studies at the University of Kelaniya.\n\nThe programme was designed to provide participants with practical insights into fund management and investment principles, bridging academic learning with industry expertise. The initiative concluded with a certification ceremony, recognising the successful completion of the course by the participants.\n\nVeteran HR leader Dr. Neil Bogahalande appointed president,CIPM Sri Lanka\n\nCrop theft costing Sri Lanka\u2019s agricultural sector millions: Industry calls for urgent government action\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment * Name *\n\nSave my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment."
