    "description": "IFC and HSBC invest US$ 40mn to upgrade Colombo Port infrastructure",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/business-news/IFC-and-HSBC-invest-US-40mn-to-upgrade-Colombo-Port-infrastructure/273-346255",
