    "chunk_text": "SLT-Mobitel opens upgraded Maharagama and Battaramulla outlets\n\nSLT-Mobitel opened its newly modernized outlets in Maharagama and Battaramulla recently.\n\nThe refurbished centres now operate with extended business hoursfrom 9.00 a.m. to 9.00 p.m. on weekdays and 9.00 a.m. to 5.00 p.m.\n\nThese retail touchpoint timings offer consumers greater flexibility to access SLT-Mobitel\u2019s comprehensive portfolio of fixed, mobile, broadband, enterprise, and digital services.\n\nIn line with SLT-Mobitel\u2019s vision of embracing digital innovation, the branches feature a digital queue management system to minimise waiting times and ensure an organised service flow.A customer service appointment booking facilityallows visitors to pre-schedule their service time for added convenience.\n\nThe fully wireless environment enables staff to serve subscribers seamlessly from any point within the premises, and support for digital payment options provides secure, fast, and cashless transactions.\n\nThese enhancements demonstrate SLT-Mobitel\u2019s ongoing commitment to deliver world-class customer service and integrate advanced digital technologies to meet the evolving needs of Sri Lankan consumers. The upgrades provide a modern, comfortable environment strengthening clientele engagement and"
