    "description": "SLCGE invites SME apparel manufacturers to join unified industry platform",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/business-news/SLCGE-invites-SME-apparel-manufacturers-to-join-unified-industry-platform/273-346369",
    "lang": "en",
