    "md5": "f01878a04d743e2513a4a032d025e2f7",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 707,
    "chunk_text": "Sustainability at Hemas is not confined to environmental metrics. It shows up in how the Group thinks about social impact - not as scattered good deeds, but as an extension of what its businesses already do well.\n\nCommercial success and societal progress are not competing goals. Done right, they reinforce each other.\n\nSustainability leadership will not come from a long list of activities - it will come from embedding its principles into the way businesses are run, and focusing on the few things that create the most impact.At Hemas, that is the direction of travel: sustainability not as a department, but as a discipline running through the business and staying true to the purpose of Enriching Lives."
