    "chunk_text": "One injured in shooting near Kuppiyawatta Cemetery in Dematagoda\n\nColombo, July 23 (Daily Mirror) - A person has sustained injuries following a shooting incident that occurred near the Kuppiyawatta cemetery in Dematagoda.\n\nAccording to reports, the incident took place when two individuals travelling on a motorcycle were targeted and fired upon by two unidentified suspects who had arrived on a separate motorcycle.\n\nThe victim who was injured in the shooting was rushed to the Colombo National Hospital."
