    "chunk_size_bytes": 720,
    "chunk_text": "TFOB Co-Founder and CEO Gayendra Rajapaksha said, \u201cIf our country\u2019s stories and our brands\u2019 stories are crafted the right way, they can play a powerful role in uplifting our economy. As brand builders and storytellers, we have a great responsibility to take our economy forward through the stories we tell. In our common cause, we don\u2019t compete with each other. We compete with the rest of the world.\u201d\n\nThat sentiment sits at the heart of what TFOB is trying to build. TFOB, which also runs workshops, masterclasses, advisory services and the podcast \u2018Anybody Can Do Marketing\u2019, positions itself as a platform for practical industry learning. Spot On is its most visible expression of that mission to date."
