    "chunk_text": "Beyond business, there is also a broader social dimension. We invest in universities, mentorship programmes, hackathons and AI learning initiatives because the future of responsible AI depends on how well we prepare the next generation of engineers to work with these technologies thoughtfully and ethically.\n\nQ 99x recently received major industry awards and beyond celebrating achievement, what do these recognitions say about the culture and direction of 99x as an organisation?\n\nWhat gives us confidence is how our people have responded to change and how our valued clients are endorsing our innovations. There is a strong sense of curiosity, humility and willingness to learn across the organisation. Teams are experimenting more, collaborating more closely with customers and pushing themselves beyond traditional\u00a0engineering roles."
