    "md5": "2dd6ce66a8e48c144641e21e0a1a6576",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1508,
    "chunk_text": "Janashakthi Finance marks 45th anniversary\n\nJanashakthi Finance PLC, a subsidiary of JXG (Janashakthi Group), marks its 45th anniversary, celebrating four and a half decades of financial expertise, customer confidence, and meaningful contributions to Sri Lanka\u2019s Non-BankFinancial Institution (NBFI) sector.\n\nThe milestone reflects the company\u2019s evolution as a trusted financial partner, built on strong relationships, sound governance, and a commitment to delivering innovative solutions that empower individuals and businesses.\n\nEstablished in 1981, Janashakthi Finance has grown into one of Sri Lanka\u2019s long established licensed finance companies, earning recognition for its customer-focused approach, operational discipline, and ability to adapt to the evolving needs of the market.\n\nSupported by the strength of its parent company, JXG (Janashakthi Group), the company continues to expand access to financial services while supporting individuals, entrepreneurs, micro, small, and medium enterprises (MSMEs), and communities across the country.\n\nOver the past 45 years, Janashakthi Finance has evolved alongside Sri Lanka\u2019s economic landscape, continuously strengthening its products, services, and customer experience to address emerging financial needs. Through its comprehensive portfolio of financial solutions, expanding reach, and relationship-driven approach, the company has enabled thousands of Sri Lankans to pursue personal aspirations, grow businesses, and create new opportunities."
