    "md5": "bed31d70dd4b04f930d654343c1efbe8",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1761,
    "chunk_text": "Robbialac\u2019s AI-powered digital Vesak campaign earns recognition from TikTok\n\nRobbialac, the flagship paints brand of Lankem Ceylon PLC, has earned international recognition from TikTok for its innovative Digital Vesak campaign, with the platform featuring the initiative as an official global business case study.\n\nThe recognition highlights how a distinctly Sri Lankan cultural celebration was successfully transformed into an immersive digital experience through creativity, technology and meaningful consumer engagement.\n\nDeveloped in collaboration with the creative technology agency Innovation Quotient (Pvt) LTD, the campaign redefined festive brand engagement by transforming the traditional Vesak lantern into an interactive digital experience.\n\nConsumers were invited to create personalised AI-generated Vesak lanterns and share customised greetings, seamlessly blending Sri Lankan cultural heritage with emerging digital technologies.\n\nThe campaign delivered exceptional marketing performance and brand exposure, generating over 1.24 million impressions, more than 147,000 website visits, 96,000+ conversions, and 7,787 AI-generated Vesak lantern creations. These results demonstrated the effectiveness of combining immersive digital experiences with culturally authentic content to drive consumer engagement and campaign participation.\n\nTikTok recognised the campaign as a global success story, showcasing it as an example of how brands can utilise the platform\u2019s advanced advertising solutions and creative capabilities to build deeper audience engagement while delivering tangible marketing outcomes. The recognition places Robbialac among a select group of brands featured by the global platform for excellence in digital marketing innovation."
  },
