    "md5": "1f0f87279436df6f82c3ae875f8ac7d2",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1531,
    "chunk_text": "AES expands digital reach through strategic partnership with Kapruka\n\nAbans Environmental Services (AES), Sri Lanka\u2019s market leader in janitorial and facility management services, is expanding its service offering on Kapruka.com, the country\u2019s largest e-commerce platform, with several services already live and more confirmed for launch. Under this partnership, Abans Environmental Services is proud to introduce several services under its portfolio. A longer list of future services that are ready to be offered to the public is currently under discussion between both parties.\n\nThe partnership was inked on 16 July 2026 with Kapruka Assistant General Manager Damitha Gunawardhana and Project Manager Himali Silva, while Director Zev Pestonjee, Assistant General Manager Chaminda Bandara, Senior General Manager Sarath Weragoda and Brand Manager Waruna Mendis signed on behalf of Abans Environmental Services Ltd.\n\nAs part of the collaboration, these services offered by Abans Environmental Services are now available for booking through the Kapruka platform. Customers can access sofa cleaning services, carpet shampooing services, apartment cleaning services, house cleaning services, and pest control services, providing households with convenient access to trusted, professional-grade cleaning and maintenance solutions through a familiar online marketplace.\n\nThe partnership will continue to expand, with floor cleaning services and glass cleaning services confirmed for introduction on the platform in the coming phase."
  },
