    "chunk_text": "Keells joins Dialog Pay merchant ecosystem\n\nDialog Axiata Group Chief Digital Services Officer Renuka Fernando (left), and Keells Supermarkets Head of Marketing and John Keells Group Senior Vice President Nilusha Fernando\n\nDialog Axiata PLC has announced that customers can now make secure and convenient digital payments using Dialog Pay at all Keells supermarkets nationwide. As one of Sri Lanka\u2019s leading supermarket chains with 150 stores across the island, Keells becomes one of the first major retail partners in the Dialog Pay merchant ecosystem, enabling customers to enjoy a seamless scan-and-pay experience while earning complimentary Dialog data rewards on eligible transactions.\n\nKeells Supermarkets Head of Marketing and John Keells Group Senior Vice President Nilusha Fernando said, \u201cAt Keells, we are constantly looking for ways to make shopping more convenient and rewarding for our customers. By introducing Dialog Pay across our supermarket network, we are expanding payment choice while delivering a faster and more seamless checkout experience. We are pleased to partner with Dialog in encouraging greater adoption of digital payments while continuing to enhance the everyday shopping experience for customers across Sri Lanka.\u201d"
