    "chunk_text": "India\u2019s education minister resigns after weeks of \u2018Cockroach\u2019 protests\n\n(ALJAZEERA) -\u00a0 India\u2019s Education Minister Dharmendra Pradhan has resigned, handing a big victory \u2060to youth protesters nationwide who had demanded that he quit to take responsibility for a series of examination paper leaks.\n\nPradhan announced his resignation on X on Saturday just as police fired tear gas to scatter the protesters in New Delhi, hours before their leaders were set to hold another round \u200cof talks with federal ministers.\n\n\u201cConsidering the situation that has arisen at Jantar Mantar and across the country, so that anti-national forces do not take advantage of this situation \u2026 I have sent my resignation letter to Prime Minister [Narendra Modi],\u201d Pradhan wrote in his post\n\n\u201cI deeply respect the \u2060aspirations, feelings, and legitimate expectations of \u2060the country\u2019s youth.\u201d\n\nPradhan said he did not want to allow tens of thousands of students calling for his resignation to be taken advantage of by \u201canti-national forces\u201d. He said he did not want to see pupils become \u201centangled in legal complexities\u201d instead of studying and building their careers.\n\nCheers erupted among the thousands of protesters who have been rallying at New Delhi\u2019s Jantar Mantar area and elsewhere as the news of Pradhan quitting spread.\n\nThe demonstrators are part of a political satire movement, known as the Cockroach Janta Party (CJP), established to channel the discontent of India\u2019s youth, many of whom believe they have been failed by Modi and his government."
