    "chunk_size_bytes": 758,
    "chunk_text": "KDK Sri Lanka strengthens regional ties through Malaysia technology visit\n\nKDK Sri Lanka recently visited Malaysia to gain a closer look at the people, technology and engineering behind KDK\u2019s product portfolio.\n\nThe Sri Lankan delegation was joined by KDK team members from Japan and Hong Kong, with the visit reflecting the company\u2019s global collaboration across markets.\n\nThe program also provided an opportunity to exchange ideas, strengthen relationships and explore the latest energy-efficient technologies, including the innovations behind KDK\u2019s newest DC fan.\n\nKDK Sri Lanka said the visit reinforces its commitment to delivering advanced engineering, greater\n\nenergy efficiency and trusted solutions backed by global expertise and local support."
  },
