    "chunk_text": "Cabinet approves proposal to extend judges\u2019 retirement age by two years\n\nColombo, July 27 (Daily Mirror) - The Cabinet has approved a controversial proposal to extend the retirement age of judges by two years.\n\nThe proposal has drawn opposition from senior members of the legal fraternity, the Bar Association of Sri Lanka (BASL) and opposition political parties.\n\nThe proposal will now be presented to Parliament for approval.\n\nSince the proposed change requires an amendment to the Constitution, it must secure a two-thirds majority in Parliament."
