    "md5": "6ea52c6a8413ad6741ecb729f3f6e8e6",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 854,
    "chunk_text": "First Capital enhances service experience with upgraded Negombo Branch\n\nFirst Capital Holdings PLC, a subsidiary of JXG (Janashakthi Group) has unveiled the newly refurbished Negombo branch, reflecting its continued commitment to delivering a premium customer experience through enhanced service standards, modern interiors and a more comfortable environment for customers.\n\nAs one of the company\u2019s top-performing locations, the upgraded branch represents First Capital\u2019s ongoing investment in strengthening its customer touchpoints and providing all clients with a seamless, elevated service experience.\n\nThe refurbished branch also features an expanded team to provide more personalised guidance and support, empowering customers to make informed financial decisions and strengthen their journey towards greater financial wellbeing and stewardship."
