    "md5": "e7140d62f9c0c0377a0596157fca4357",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 827,
    "chunk_text": "Union Bank\u2019s Dilshan Rodrigo appointed to LankaPay board\n\nUnion Bank announced the appointment of its Director and Chief Executive Officer Dilshan Rodrigo to the board of directors of LankaPay, Sri Lanka\u2019s national payment network.\n\nThis appointment reflects Rodrigo\u2019s extensive experience and leadership in the banking and financial services sector as well as his commitment to advancing innovation and digital transformation within the industry.\u00a0 As a Director of LankaPay, Rodrigo will contribute to strengthening Sri Lanka\u2019s national payments infrastructure and supporting the continued development of secure, efficient and inclusive digital payment solutions.\n\nHis appointment further reinforces Union Bank\u2019s commitment to driving progress and fostering collaboration across the country\u2019s financial ecosystem."
