    "chunk_text": "During its first year, CSE Clear successfully facilitated the clearing and settlement of equity market transactions with high operational reliability while maintaining robust risk management practices. The organisation established a comprehensive margining framework, introduced a Contributory Guarantee Fund to strengthen default management capabilities and advanced risk monitoring to safeguard market stability under a wide range of market conditions. And successfully cleared and settled Rs.1,188 billion worth of transactions through more than eight million trades.\n\nCSE Chief Executive Officer Rajeeva Bandaranaike added, \u201cI extend my warm congratulations to CSE Clear on its first anniversary. This achievement marks an important milestone in the ongoing development of Sri Lanka\u2019s capital market and its future growth.\u201d\n\nCommenting on the milestone, CSE Clear Head Dulani Warnakulasooriya said, \u201cReaching our first anniversary is a proud milestone for CSE Clear and a reflection of the dedication and collaboration of everyone involved. I would like to sincerely thank our regulator, clearing members, custodian banks and all market participants for their unwavering support, commitment and partnership throughout this inaugural year. Despite the complexity of the transition, we have established a resilient clearing infrastructure that enhances market confidence and effectively manages settlement risk. Our focus now is to continue strengthening our risk management framework, enhance operational efficiency through greater automation and support future market initiatives that align Sri Lanka with the evolving global market standards.\u201d"
