    "chunk_text": "Commenting on the milestone, CSE Clear Head Dulani Warnakulasooriya said, \u201cReaching our first anniversary is a proud milestone for CSE Clear and a reflection of the dedication and collaboration of everyone involved. I would like to sincerely thank our regulator, clearing members, custodian banks and all market participants for their unwavering support, commitment and partnership throughout this inaugural year. Despite the complexity of the transition, we have established a resilient clearing infrastructure that enhances market confidence and effectively manages settlement risk. Our focus now is to continue strengthening our risk management framework, enhance operational efficiency through greater automation and support future market initiatives that align Sri Lanka with the evolving global market standards.\u201d"
