    "chunk_text": "International Dhamma Programme to mark Esala Full Moon Poya on July 29\n\nColombo, July 28 (Daily Mirror) - An International Dhamma Programme will be held on Wednesday, July 29, to mark Esala Full Moon Poya Day, bringing together participants for an online Dhamma talk via Zoom.\n\nThe programme will be conducted from 6.00 p.m. to 7.30 p.m. (Sri Lanka time/IST) and is open to participants worldwide.\n\nThose wishing to attend are required to register in advance through the official Zoom registration link -https://us06web.zoom.us/webinar/register/WN_3s5sp5UCQF6wtgZbdgGbTQ.\n\nUpon registration, participants will receive a confirmation email containing details on how to join the webinar."
