    "chunk_text": "The return to profit did not translate into positive operating cash flow. The group used Rs.678.1 million in operating activities, as trade and other receivables increased by Rs.3.43 billion during the quarter. Trade and other payables rose by Rs.2.35 billion.\n\nTotal group equity was Rs.15.59 billion, compared with Rs.4.07 billion a year earlier. Retained losses stood at Rs.9.23 billion at the end of the quarter.\n\nThe company changed its financial year-end from December to March to align its reporting period with parent Mazagon Dock Shipbuilders Limited. The results are subject to audit."
