    "description": "Sri Lanka pharma sets sights on US$ 1.8tn global market",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/business-main/Sri-Lanka-pharma-sets-sights-on-US-1-8tn-global-market/245-346859",
    "lang": "en",
