    "description": "Pathfinder Foundation, Indian High Commission and ICCR hold symposium on strengthening Pali language studies",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/news/Pathfinder-Foundation-Indian-High-Commission-and-ICCR-hold-symposium-on-strengthening-Pali-language-studies/56-795292",
    "lang": "en",
