    "chunk_text": "BASL special general meeting begins amid large lawyer turnout\n\nColombo, July 29 (Daily MIrror) - The Bar Association of Sri Lanka (BASL) Special General Meeting of its General Membership commenced a short while ago at the BASL Head Office in Hulftsdorp, with a large number of lawyers in attendance.\n\nThe government\u2019s proposed constitutional amendment seeking to extend the retirement age of judges will be discussed at the Special General Meeting."
