    "description": "Iran to get Chinese shoulder-launched missile systems in weeks: Reuters",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/international/Iran-to-get-Chinese-shoulder-launched-missile-systems-in-weeks-Reuters/107-346880",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailymirrorlk",
