    "description": "Reclaiming the Republic: Why True Judicial Efficiency Demands Systemic Reform Over Retirement Age Extensions",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/breaking-news/Reclaiming-the-Republic-Why-True-Judicial-Efficiency-Demands-Systemic-Reform-Over-Retirement-Age-Extensions/108-346884",
